d just called  him sin there would be no reason for him  to be so shocked because everyone else  knows him as sin now no one else in the  party saw this strange woman only sin  and this seems to support the theory  that sin is not really who he claims to  be i keep thinking and hoping that he is  actually born the fox's sin of greed and  that he was somehow turned into a fox  against his will in order to hide his  identity while he figures out how to  return to his human form bond just  adopted the name sin as in fox's sin  that would definitely make sense to me  especially if this strange woman was  somehow connected to the lady of the  lake the person who abducted bond's son  lancelot we'll have to wait and see i am  100 sure that sin is directly connected  to bonn and lancelot in some way i'm  just not sure how exactly my guess is  that sin is actually bon but that's just  a hunch the gang suddenly comes across a  hidden village near the summit of the  mountain range the villagers notice them  and start smiling and waving and while  percival and donny are intrigued and  asians think this village is kind of  weird then a man shows up with his dog  and he warns the gang not to go into the  village because it is dangerous but it's  already too late for percival and donny  who are heading for the village as we  speak at full speed sin rushes in after  them in an attempt to turn them away and  they end up passing through some sort of  magical barrier which apparently traps  them inside the village as we see all  the villagers smiling with eyes that  look completely blank the man with the  dog tells anne and aseans that the  village their friends just ran into is  no village at all it is a den of  monsters it's pretty obvious from the  start that something is off with this  village but that is only the beginning  of the drama that ensues during this arc  the crazy twists just keep coming and i  actually love them so let me walk you  through all of them the man with the dog  introduces himself as a hunter named ard  and he explains that this mysterious  village appeared only 10 years ago and  while the people inside the village may  appear like normal people as soon as any  of them leaves the magical barrier that  surrounds the village they instantly  turn into monsters the leader of the  village is especially interesting he's a  tall elderly bearded man and sin is  immediately suspicious of him according  to sin this village elder has been using  some sort of bird to spy on our heroes  since before they entered the mountains  and then when percival reveals that the  fox's name is sin the elder has the  exact same reaction as me he's like sin  the fox's name is sin sin the fox and  i'm just like yes bro this guy gets it  it has to be directly related to bon the  fox's sin of greed anyway the elder asks  in to talk to him in private and the two  of them leave while percival and donnie  are served a bunch of food by the other  villagers meanwhile in their private  meeting the elder seems to have knocked  sin out i mean sin is literally on the  floor passed out and the elder tells  them to rest as long as he'd like as all  of this is happening in the village art  explains to ana asians that the only way  to help their friends escape is to  destroy the strange stone idol at the  center of the village art volunteers to  create a diversion while ananasians  destroy the idol and although nazianz is  suspicious about why art would be so  eager to risk his own life to help them  ann assures him that art hasn't lied  about anything since she has the power  to detect lies we have to assume that  art is being sincere when he says that  he just wants to prevent innocent people  from being hurt by these monsters so art  proceeds with his distraction while ana  and asians head for the idol at first  they think that donny and percival are  being attacked by the villagers but it  turns out that they're just having a  great time playing around strangely  enough percival is able to communicate  with the villagers even though they  speak a foreign language that does not  originate in britannia and percival  doesn't even seem to know why he can  understand the language which isn't even  surprising when it comes to percival  it's just how he rolls and then manages  to destroy the idol with the help of her  horse and then suddenly all of the  villagers are revealed for what they  truly are they are not humans all of  them are demons more specifically they  are all lower ranked red and grey demons  that we are so familiar with from the  original series as the villager's true  form is revealed art reveals his own  true identity he is actually a holy  night of camelot and he is committed to  returning britannia to the human race  even if that means exterminating  everyone else oh and also his dog is  actually a monster so there's that but  here's the interesting thing anne is  expecting that these horrible demons are  gonna attack them and eat her friends  but the demons turn out to be extremely  nice they weren't putting up an act  earlier when they were in human form  they really are just chill guys and they  really do want to be friends with  percival and the others despite their  demonic appearance and despite what we  saw other red and grey demons do in the  past these particular demons really are  peace loving creatures but now that the  idol has been broken the holy knight  ardberg formerly known as ard has  infiltrated the village he is a holy  knight in king arthur's service and he  vows to exterminate all of these members  of the demon clan the elder tries to  explain that these demons refused to  fight in the holy war and that they  decided to hide out here specifically  because they didn't want to hurt anyone  but ardberg doesn't care he believes  that all demons are evil without  exception and that they all must be  destroyed in order to protect humans  ardberg then uses a crystal known as the  amber of 